		"description": "<p>At 7th level, you shrug off effects that harm others and might keep you from your cause. When you make a Constitution or Wisdom save for half damage, you instead take no damage. In addition, when under the continuing effects of a spell which allows a Constitution or Wisdom save at the end of your turn to throw off, you instead make the save at the start of your turn.</p>",
